# Generated / machine-specific build artifacts — never committed (mirrors the
# screen-guard / share-intent `.gitignore` discipline, adapted for the iOS plugin).
# `.tauri/` is the generated Tauri-API surface; `ios/.build/` holds SwiftPM +
# SourceKit index output (incl. binary `*.mdb`); `Package.resolved` re-resolves
# from the local `../.tauri/tauri-api` path at each build.
/.tauri
/ios/.build
/ios/Package.resolved
